      "writtenOn": "2020-01-16T18:22:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we have a test strategy that\u0027s more centered on externally-observable behavior ? For example this test does not react at all to a removal of the call to checkConnectivityDiagnosticsPermissions before sending the callback.\n\nSomething like :\n① Have a uid register a callback and check that we throw\n② Grant permissions to that UID\n③ Have it register a callback, check that it succeeds\n④ Generate a fake event, check that the callback is indeed called\n⑤ Revoke permissions\n⑥ Generate a fake event, check that the callback is not called after 500ms or so",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6357,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 6357,
        "endChar": 59
      },
